## Notes

- This is a PROPER cleanup - not just comment removal
- Each TODO must be resolved by either implementing the feature or removing the code
- Do not leave any "coming soon" or "future implementation" markers
- The codebase should be production-ready after this cleanup
- Any remaining placeholders should only be legitimate UI empty states

